OL,3,GNEWSANightmare before Christmas after
OL,4,A'sorry' tree installed
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors in a Lancashire town were
OL,7,Fleft red faced after seeing their
OL,8,Fworse-for-wear Christmas tree installed
OL,9,Fin the market square.
OL,11,FIn a statement on social media,
OL,12,FBlackburn with Darwen Council said:
OL,13,F"How many times have you ordered
OL,14,Fsomething, only for it to arrive and
OL,15,Fnot be quite what you were expecting?"
OL,17,FCouncillor Matt Jackson told BBC Radio
OL,18,FLancashire that a local resident first
OL,19,Falerted him to the "sorry" tree,
OL,20,Fsending a picture with the caption
OL,21,F"this is truly terrible".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
