OL,3,GNEWSANightmare before Christmas after
OL,4,A'sorry' tree installed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council, which says it is "not
OL,7,Fhappy" with the somewhat flaccid tree,
OL,8,Fsaid a suitable replacement would be
OL,9,Finstalled on Wednesday in time for the
OL,10,FChristmas light switch-on at the
OL,11,Fweekend.
